This question tests integration of privacy-preserving computation with hardware-assisted trust, and designs that scale across untrusted fog nodes while preserving tenant isolation.

## Key Concepts

- Threshold cryptography
- Trusted Execution Environments
- Secure aggregation
- Provenance and replay protection
